3d-5774-af34-51dfba3c9462" :question/math-academy-id "q-8063" :question/problem "Find the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{16}=1.$" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{4}=2,\\,b=\\sqrt{16}=4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{4}{2}x \\\\  & =\\pm 2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-8063/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3340444-0db2-5cdd-8032-02955fc2dae0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-8063"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316483/field-1/1f836158b6cc5a6bb9a268699a1c95cf10d1cac4bdba25934d60d9f13e3fba61" :answer/id #uuid "bc821cd4-56ef-589b-b902-a2913bf2522e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{7}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316483/field-1/80a3684149982ee33303998c80b8e6b1ccd2843c5c45550d8b4afe903ee17065" :answer/id #uuid "ed6d8529-3039-5dcf-b049-623bd4e7fd82" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{7}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316483/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f916b28-a2b2-5d1f-8da1-0944caa29a1a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316483/field-1/1f836158b6cc5a6bb9a268699a1c95cf10d1cac4bdba25934d60d9f13e3fba61" :answer-field/choices ["q-316483/field-1/1f836158b6cc5a6bb9a268699a1c95cf10d1cac4bdba25934d60d9f13e3fba61" "q-316483/field-1/80a3684149982ee33303998c80b8e6b1ccd2843c5c45550d8b4afe903ee17065"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316483" :question/id #uuid "22207d4a-7170-5907-84c8-3410385aa793" :ques