 "The asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{36}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}=1$ are$\\,\\,y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{36}=6,\\,b=\\sqrt{4}=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{6}{2}x \\\\  & =\\pm 3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316506/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0095663f-b994-5ed0-ab96-e9270b71cf98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316506"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-116557/selection/f5a490c1e0663d8579042f5ae81987f04af0093e4ef74beac0dd51d469195402" :answer/id #uuid "a6ed1d1a-7c6f-5eff-9f7d-82eba046ace4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{1}{3}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-116557/selection/dea35230d026e65e13e7e7e95a7b632873c8ac527414ac3336c20660e8689cb5" :answer/id #uuid "d1eda4e6-8c72-55db-8c57-ddf5db12c024" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{1}{9}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-116557/selection/b59ec54733f21c0f6d9b829a1ffef062f5ecfb4f5024133fd2bb4f923ecdf4e7" :answer/id #uuid "7fae46d4-e12e-5ca1-98d6-4cca1ffcd1f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm 3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-116557/selection/855edccd5a3f964e357675630a4adf86de85c7745483a62ff4e2fcc6f6f88a14" :answer/id #uuid "4b9fee9c-774a-58e9-a85a-c4a4a072c923" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm 9x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-116557/selection/affc44e75be907b524be98da14efcc6fc5f0dd8f8e4d8a6ffbd4987a9324b637" :answer/id #uuid "ae509c9c-eea8-52c4-a40b-b24bb686226