mptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}=1.$" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{4}=2,\\,b=\\sqrt{16}=4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{2}{4}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{1}{2}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10431/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0095663f-b994-5ed0-ab96-e9270b71cf98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10431"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316963/field-1/2454e66bd9f8561ecfd7e856b33f5a7df119c9ba295797efb1bbda963d145b37" :answer/id #uuid "93af386e-8735-5b32-b2f5-ef2606875efc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316963/field-1/1d8e4d4ca05809b4ff03e4ab5c8a87e8ac0dbc724f449ca6244d0db5e7d4cddb" :answer/id #uuid "6a51d73b-58c9-57fc-b200-825915834004" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316963/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9fb2cbfa-9dbb-59dc-836f-e963cbae97d3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316963/field-1/2454e66bd9f8561ecfd7e856b33f5a7df119c9ba295797efb1bbda963d145b37" :answer-field/choices ["q-316963/field-1/2454e66bd9f8561ecfd7e856b33f5a7df119c9ba295797efb1bbda963d145b37" "q-316963/field-1/1d8e4d4ca05809b4ff03e4ab5c8a87e8ac0dbc724f449ca6244d0db5e7d4cddb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316963" :question/id #uuid "5965a1ab-365c-593b-8311-3ccd4428a7fb" :question/math-academy-id "q-316963" :question/problem "The asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{100}=1$ are$\\,\\,y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{4}=2,\\,b=\\sqrt{100}=10.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{2}{10}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{1}{5}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316963/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0095663f-b994-5ed0-ab96-e9270b71cf98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316963"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316965/field-1/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4" :answer/id #uuid "4229a252-e235-5e97-b713-d78698c12011" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316965/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "22250f67-3925-51fe-97c6-335c7eee5241" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316965/field-1/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4" :answer-field/choices ["q-316965/field-1/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316965" :question/id #uuid "f68d254f-bdd5-5c65-9cd4-cfe81ad88b23" :question/math-academy-id "q-316965" :question/problem "The asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{36}=1$ are$\\,\\,y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}x.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\na=\\sqrt{16}=4,\\,b=\\sqrt{36}=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{4}{6}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{2}{3}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316965/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0095663f-b994-5ed0-ab96-e9270b71cf98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316965"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316942/field-1/0d2b8f05b44258448eaf1a704bed9dbb898863e6fac63635a9481c5426d1e820" :answer/id #uuid "90de5a26-0670-5116-be4a-52b88948bb8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316942/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6f2957b4-c382-5ad4-a03d-5f08a1cf016b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316942/field-1/0d2b8f05b44258448eaf1a704bed9dbb898863e6fac63635a9481c5426d1e820" :answer-field/choices ["q-316942/field-1/0d2b8f05b44258448eaf1a704bed9dbb898863e6fac63635a9481c5426d1e820"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316942" :question/id #uuid "04d57fc4-cc71-576b-b6ac-65013f6fe99e" :question/math-academy-id "q-316942" :question/problem "The asymptotes of the hyperbola ${x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}=8$ are$\\,\\,y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}x.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, we divide both sides of the equation by $8$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2} & =8 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{2{y}^{2}}{8} & =\\frac{8}{8} \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have $a=\\sqrt{8}$ and $b=\\sqrt{4}=2.$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\pm \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{8}}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{2}{2\\sqrt{2}}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}x \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316942/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ca7c76e6-204b-5b30-8e62-c53027b63448"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316942"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection/0ad083c5357f0cfe48fb64a11b9055b40e80c9dd33cdad0f04b0c0ed915c89d7" :answer/id #uuid "d6a5746a-33a6-572e-8537-f35a0fe291fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{3}{4}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection/85dfdc3eacb92072ed0935d89ae78d3fe1e3e66f5607b749375b4fe69132cf29" :answer/id #uuid "691de324-2dbb-5042-aecf-654108b4514e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{3}{2}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection/241d7f4e546f231146c45879647fbc0d9ba1003e4f509d0800db9e8a54ece31e" :answer/id #uuid "5aecc861-2c55-5a18-9f4f-bb13b58d5de1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{5}{4}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection/bbe5e63917119ee7237fdd695e959c25e33b08f6f04aa7a4e3856421aa97d053" :answer/id #uuid "f6f47ac3-c62e-5468-a2b4-64fcd86123ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{2}{5}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection/b8b02456486afaaf9fa5a88ff252016c8e4510cef18af6e19199674056f6ddbc" :answer/id #uuid "116e4da2-3657-55f5-9113-12d1bf0a9439" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\pm \\frac{5}{2}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-7973/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2a03dbb9-7255-55d7-a825-a78a34648f7a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-7973/selection/b8b02456486afaaf9fa5a